      "curriculum": "AC9M5A01",
      "type": "numeric",
      "prompt": "Mia knows that 12 × 15 = 180. Use this to work out 180 ÷ 15.",
      "answer": 12,
      "difficulty": 2,
      "explanation": "Division undoes multiplication. 12 × 15 = 180, so 180 ÷ 15 = 12."
    },
    {
